<section id="story" class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="chapter">
      <div class="chapter__copy stack">
        <span class="hm-paper hm-label hm-label--mono hm-tilt-l" data-reveal>CHAPTER 1 · 2013–2025</span>
        <h2 class="hm-headline">
          <span class="hm-paper hm-label hm-label--display strip-lg hm-tilt-r1" data-reveal>12 YEARS AT PRISMA MEDIA</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="narrator">He kept Gala and Harper's Bazaar fast for millions of readers. No pressure.</p>
        <p class="hm-paper card hm-tilt-l1" data-reveal>
          As Tech Lead and technical referent for high-traffic media sites, I owned availability, latency and infrastructure
          cost. I rebuilt Gala.fr and Voici.fr on Symfony, Elasticsearch and Varnish, migrated on-premise infrastructure to
          AWS and a microservices architecture, industrialised CI/CD (Docker, GitLab CI, Ansible) across three teams and led
          a team of three developers. Before that, 4 years at Smile building platforms for JCDecaux, Groupama AM, Yves
          Rocher, AFNOR, Icade and L'Équipe.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img
