        </h2>
        <p class="hm-paper hm-paper--ink hm-label hm-label--mono hm-tilt-l" data-reveal>EPITA <span class="x">×</span> EM NORMANDIE</p>
        <p class="narrator">He talks to language models all day. They talk back.</p>
        <p class="hm-paper card hm-tilt-r1" data-reveal>
